# VIGIL staleness-alarm monitor — config for vigil-alerts.service (W8-1 #467).
# Copy to ~/.config/vigil/alerts.env, chmod 600, and set at least one push destination.
# The unit runs even if this file is absent (EnvironmentFile=- makes it optional), but with
# --require-push a missing destination is itself an alarm — configure one below.

# --- push destinations (set one or both; a webhook URL may be a bearer secret → keep 0600) -----------------
# HTTP POST each alarm as JSON to this URL (Slack/Discord/PagerDuty/Alertmanager webhook, an internal
# receiver, etc.). Non-2xx or a transport error is a delivery FAILURE (recorded locally + dead-man).
# VIGIL_ALERT_WEBHOOK_URL=https://hooks.example.internal/vigil-alerts

# Run a command per alarm, fed the alarm JSON on stdin. Use for email/pager. A non-zero exit is a delivery
# FAILURE. Examples:
#   VIGIL_ALERT_EXEC=/usr/sbin/sendmail -t                     # with a wrapper that builds the message, or
#   VIGIL_ALERT_EXEC=/usr/local/bin/notify-oncall.sh
# VIGIL_ALERT_EXEC=

# --- state dir (keep in sync with the monitored units' StateDirectory=vigil) -------------------------------
# Where per-unit heartbeats live. The .service already sets this to %S/vigil/unit-heartbeats; override only
# if you changed StateDirectory in the monitored units too.
# VIGIL_ALERT_STATE_DIR=%h/.local/state/vigil/unit-heartbeats

# --- tuning (all optional; cadence-derived, fail-closed defaults) ------------------------------------------
# Per-unit staleness bound override, in seconds. <UNIT> is the unit name upper-cased with non-alnum → '_'.
# Defaults to cadence*1.5 + the timer's RandomizedDelaySec (fires after ~1.5 missed periods). Examples:
# VIGIL_ALERT_MAX_STALENESS_VIGIL_BACKUP_SERVICE=172800        # alarm a daily backup after 2 days
# VIGIL_ALERT_MAX_STALENESS_VIGIL_HA_MIRROR_SERVICE=1800       # alarm the 15m mirror after 30m

# The delivery dead-man: if no alert has been successfully pushed in this long, the alerting path is
# considered down (a watchdog / `vigil alerts --status` surfaces it). Default 93600 (26h).
# VIGIL_ALERT_DELIVERY_MAX_STALENESS_S=93600
